  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Grain shipment from Ukraine (Kenya)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A shipment of 25,000 metric tonnes of wheat from Ukraine, which will provide life-saving food assistance and nutrient-rich commodities to approximately 820,000 vulnerable people in Kenya, including refugees, and provide a seasonal safety net to local communities in response to drought.</narrative>
  </description>
